            <ArticleTitle>Providing better asthma care for children in school.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>12-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Assessing the needs of children, young people and families is a fundamental part of the school nurse's role. This article describes a project in Doncaster that has enabled a partnership working with children, young people, families, school nurses and school staff aimed at providing improved services throughout the primary and secondary school day.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
